<Base title="Privacy policy for AI Editing Studio visitors" description="How AI Editing Studio treats enquiries and text you send. This site has no accounts, no payments and no tracking scripts of our own." path="privacy/">
<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>This website is static. It has no accounts, no payment forms and no analytics or advertising scripts added by us. It is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log visits under its own policy.</p>
<h2>Enquiries</h2>
<p>If you contact us, we use what you send only to reply and to quote for your job.</p>
<h2>Text you send for editing</h2>
<p>Editing uses AI tools. Please remove personal data and confidential client information from text before sending it. If your document must contain such data, tell us in your enquiry and we will agree a way forward before any processing.</p>
<h2>Questions</h2>
<p>Use the contact page to ask about your data or request deletion of anything you sent us.</p>
<p>This policy is a plain-language draft for v1 and will be reviewed when a domain and enquiry inbox are set up.</p>
</Base>
